### NestJS Service, Dependency Injection & Custom Providers
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Ambil Semua Buku dari Service
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

### 2. Ambil Buku ID #1
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1

### 3. Cek Denda Buku Terlambat 5 Hari (Custom Provider: PENALTY_CALCULATOR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1/penalty-check?daysLate=5
